    <string name="testcfg_consent_title">Start a real call?</string>
    <string name="testcfg_consent_body">This places a real call to your carrier\'s *99# / UPI 123 service to check setup on your SIM. Standard call or USSD charges from your operator may apply.</string>
    <string name="testcfg_ussd_instr_title">How to Set Up *99#</string>
    <string name="testcfg_ussd_instr_body">When the system USSD menu appears, select your bank or enter the first 4 letters of your bank\'s IFSC code (e.g., PUNB, SBIN, HDFC) and follow the prompts to link your account.</string>
    <string name="testcfg_upi123_instr_title">How to Set Up UPI 123Pay</string>
    <string name="testcfg_upi123_instr_body">We will dial NPCI\'s official UPI 123Pay IVR (08045163666). Choose your preferred language on the keypad and clearly state your bank name into the microphone when prompted.</string>
